<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-2766] Cache instance is closed when client disconnects</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2766</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In case client disconnects and reconnects after network timeout (i.e., with a new ID), all cache instances acquired by this client are closed and are not functional. User has to create a special logic to handle this case.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Cache proxy should be able to handle this automatically.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12947115">IGNITE-2766</key>
            <summary>Cache instance is closed when client disconnects</summary>
